    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`kickoffDevDeapServer` is the development DEAP server module for the `kickoff` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for dev-scoped data pipeline server activation and runtime topology. Data consumer, processor, and publisher behavior belongs in DEAP modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Server configuration should remain layered and environment-scoped."
    }
  ],
